<p>Seeking greenlight.<br />
SCP Article.</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: SCP-XXXX is a lawnmower that perpetually gets faster and doesn't suffer from wind resistance or interact with physical objects, until it comes into contact with grass. When it touches grass it becomes 'real' and suffers the effects of wind resistance from the speed that it is going.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: This is an anomaly created by a new POI, who created this specifically to mow their lawn for them without any effort. This SCP was found moving away from this POI's place of residence at very high speeds, allowing the foundation to get a rough idea to where this POI lives.</p>
<p>Hook: Its a dangerous lawnmower that moves super fast.</p>

